      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Loc Peasant Village",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Peasants \n\u0022The Empire controls these peasants no more! We are free now, under the leadership of Lord Kyn!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Loc Lord Kyn\u0027s Manor",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Rogue Squire \n\u0022Stay away from us! Leave the good Lord Kyn alone! He is a leader who truly care for his people!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Loc Spearman at wall",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spearman\r\u0022The Empire\u0027s reign is over! Lord Kyn has forbidden Empire soldiers from the Highlands until we are declared free!\u0022\r\n",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Loc Spearman Watch",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spearman  \n\u0022Wait! I wouldn\u0027t recommend you go any further! The Legions will burn you to a crisp!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loc Spearman Watch",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0004",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Spearman  \n\u0022Alert the guards! Enemy troops approaching!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Emp Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022After we persuaded the Highlander Vaglan to see our side of things, we commenced planning our attack on the northern Legions frontiers.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022With the guidance of Vaglan, we have strategically placed four of our finest warriors on the front lines of the battlegrounds, ready to capture the enemy cities.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0005",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022It is only left to be seen whether the Legions will seek help from the Undead Hordes who reside far to the East. If they do, this affront may be harder than planned.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Und Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022Our policy of waiting and watching is finally paying off, Master. It seems that the Legions have left themselves very vulnerable to a strong frontal attack from the Empire.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022This has created the fortunate climate of chaos within the Highlands. We now have the opportunity to foil both our adversaries while they are weak and spread thin.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0006",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022We have sent out many spies within the lands to investigate these events to be able to plan the perfect time to strike.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Leg Intro",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022When Vaglan failed to cooperate with our plans, our empire was thrown into crisis. Emergency meetings with the Overlords of our allied town failed to produce any definite solutions\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022The Lesser Demons Alliance was then formed. Without trust that the mighty Legions of the Damned could protect them, they segregated themselves from us. This leaves us in a very weak position.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0007",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022We must somehow recapture the cities and bring down the Alliance to show the people their true ruler!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Loc Thug Territory1",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0008",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thugs \n\u0022Halt! This territory belongs to us! If you want to live, you\u0027ll turn around and run on home.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0009",
