    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S255SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S255EV0014",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Advisor \n\u0022The city of Dragon Vale lies ahead. It is said that it was once a glorious city run by the Great Dragons. However, the Legions devastated it in the Great War, and the dragon spirits haunt the grounds.\u0022",
